# 4. SSID VS BSSID

### SSID

Human-readable network name.

Example:

```text
NAVLAN-WIFI
```

### BSSID

Typically the MAC address identifying a particular AP radio.

Example:

```text
AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF
```

### Exam trap

> Two APs can have the same SSID.

Therefore:

```text
Same SSID ≠ automatically Evil Twin
```

