### Personal

Usually uses:

> PSK / password-based authentication

Example:

```text
Wi-Fi password
```

### Enterprise

Usually uses:

> 802.1X + authentication server such as RADIUS

Conceptually:

```text
Client
  ↓
AP
  ↓
