# 46. MASTER INCIDENT ANALYSIS

Suppose Wireshark shows:

```text
Many ARP replies
     +
Gateway MAC changes
     +
Victim traffic changes
```

Possible hypothesis:

> ARP spoofing / MITM.

But validate against:

- Network topology
- DHCP
- Switch information
- Known gateway
- Timestamps
