# 47. WIRELESS INCIDENT

Suppose WIDS reports:

```text
Unknown BSSID
Same SSID as corporate Wi-Fi
Different security
Strong signal
Multiple clients connecting
```

Best conclusion:

> Potential Evil Twin / Rogue AP requiring investigation.

Not:

> "100% confirmed Evil Twin."

